==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fro|en}} {{term|foresterie|lang=fro}}, from {{term|forest|lang=fro}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|forestries}}

# The science of planting and growing [[trees]] in [[forests]].
# {{rfd-sense}} The art and practice of planting and growing trees in forests.
# The art and practice of [[cultivating]], [[exploiting]] and renewing forests for commercial purposes.
# {{rfd-sense}} Commercial [[tree]] farming.
# {{context|countable|lang=en}} A tree farm.

====Synonyms====
* [[silviculture]], [[sylviculture]]

